## Section 4: Root Cause Bottleneck Analysis

```
                    USER SPACE                             KERNEL SPACE
+-------------------------------------------------+  +----------------------+
|  App Thread (Ring 3)                           |  | Kernel Engine (Ring 0)
|  +-------------------------------------------+  |  |                      |
|  | 1. Dynamic Uprobe: Execute INT3          |--+  |                      |
|  +-------------------------------------------+  |  |                      |
|                        |                        |  |                      |
|                        v (Hardware Trap)        |  |                      |
|  +-------------------------------------------+  |  |                      |
|  | 2. CPU Trap Vector Table Switch           |==|==>  3. do_int3() Handler|
|  +-------------------------------------------+  |  |  +------------------+|
|                        ^                        |  |  | Save Reg Context ||
|                        |                        |  |  +------------------+|
|                        | (IRET / Ring 3)        |  |         |            |
